  "metadata": {
    "type": "DataPipeline",
    "displayName": "PL_FMD_ORCHESTRATION_TEMPLATE",
    "description": "Top-of-day orchestrator and the pipeline to schedule: runs PL_FMD_LOAD_ALL (Landingzone/Bronze/Silver) with the LoadGroup parameter, then one Gold-layer pipeline per business domain (wired in by NB_SETUP_BUSINESS_DOMAINS), each dependsOn PL_FMD_LOAD_ALL Succeeded. Add one schedule per cadence, each with its own LoadGroup (empty = all sources). concurrency 1: overlapping runs wait. See wiki/LoadGroup_Scheduling.md."
  },
